## Imagery
- Sentinel-2 cloudless 2016 - https://s2maps.eu by EOX IT Services GmbH (Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data
  2016 & 2017), CC BY 4.0. Layer s2cloudless_3857.
  - Globe: zoom 4 (whole Earth), assets/world.jpg copied from ../cs_globe (tools/fetch_world.py; URLs in raw/manifest_world.jsonl).
  - Tristan da Cunha patch: zoom 11, 12.95–11.95 W, 37.6–36.75 S (Tristan, Inaccessible, Nightingale), tools/fetch_patch.py
    → assets/tdc_albedo.jpg. Only the 2016 release is used (later Sentinel-2 cloudless releases are CC BY-NC-SA).
  - Imagery colour-graded (land warmed, deep ocean darkened); in the patch the open sea farther than ~2.5–6 km from land is
    replaced by the flat sea colour of the globe (the mosaic there is a patchwork of a cloudy scene and a flat fill) — "modified".
- Elevation (Tristan patch only, true scale, no exaggeration): AWS Terrain Tiles (Mapzen / Tilezen "terrarium" PNG), zoom 11,
  https://registry.opendata.aws/terrain-tiles/ (sources include SRTM, GMTED, ETOPO1, GEBCO).
- Every download URL and date is logged in raw/manifest.jsonl (downloaded 2026-11-28).

